<title>UK: Kingfisher shares seen higher after results.</title>
<headline>Kingfisher shares seen higher after results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Kingfisher Plc were expected to open higher on Wednesday, after the retailer posted profits at the top end of the range of analyst forecasts and said the current year had started encouragingly.</p>
<p>&quot;The results look very good, with profits at the top of the range of expectations, it looks pretty good across the board,&quot; said one analyst.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
